{
    "key": "fitness-yoga",
    "templateKey": "repobot-fitness-yoga",
    "title": "Yoga & Pilates Studio",
    "description": "A yoga and pilates studio's site in the atelier register — paper-white ground, hairline rules, tracked-caps type — with warm bone-and-sand photography carrying all the light: a live weekly class-schedule grid computed from one content file (today highlighted, a 'Next class / In session' badge derived from the clock), teacher bios as full-frame portraits, mat and reformer membership tiers, and a two-week introduction lead form. Five pages, all edited in a single content file.",
    "marketingExampleTitle": "Yoga studio site",
    "category": "fitness",
    "homePath": "/",
    "previewPath": "/yoga",
    "homeViewDir": "web/app/src/View/FitnessYoga",
    "base": "landing",
    "clientOnly": true,
    "capabilities": ["IOS", "ANDROID"],
    "isDefault": false,
    "theme": {
        "$comment": "The atelier register's overlay: mode light opens the site on gallery-white paper (the appearance toggle still swaps to the dim charcoal-gallery variant), and the register's near-ink accent rides as the project brand so app-side surfaces wear the same quiet register as the marketing pages instead of the kernel default blue. Brand values match atelier's own light/dark accents — the marketing pages resolve brand over preset accent, so keeping them identical means the overlay re-brands the app without shifting the pages. The warmth is the photography's job, never the chrome's.",
        "mode": "light",
        "brand": {
            "primary": "#211f1c",
            "primaryDark": "#e9e7e2"
        }
    },
    "contentContract": {
        "$comment": "The pack's content slots, as data (packs/README.md 'Content contract'). Declares what a composer (agent or tool) must bind for a generated variant of this pack to present as real: slot paths into the typed content module, their kinds, and minimums. Authored alongside the module and guarded by the pack's content tests — the module satisfies the contract; the contract never drifts ahead of it. The schedule is the signature slot: day/start/end are NUMBERS (weekday index and minutes since midnight) that the schedule engine computes the live badge and the grid from — a composer must bind them as numbers, never prose.",
        "module": "web/app/src/View/FitnessYoga/content.ts",
        "slots": {
            "studio.name": { "kind": "text" },
            "studio.tagline": { "kind": "text" },
            "studio.city": { "kind": "text" },
            "studio.address": { "kind": "text" },
            "studio.phone": { "kind": "text" },
            "studio.email": { "kind": "text" },
            "weeklySchedule": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 8,
                "item": {
                    "day": { "kind": "number" },
                    "start": { "kind": "number" },
                    "end": { "kind": "number" },
                    "title": { "kind": "text" },
                    "instructor": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "teachers": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 3,
                "item": {
                    "name": { "kind": "text" },
                    "role": { "kind": "text" },
                    "bio": { "kind": "text" },
                    "photo": { "kind": "media" }
                }
            },
            "memberships": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 2,
                "item": {
                    "name": { "kind": "text" },
                    "monthly": { "kind": "number" },
                    "yearlyPerMonth": { "kind": "number" },
                    "description": { "kind": "text" },
                    "features": { "kind": "text[]", "min": 3 }
                }
            },
            "singleVisits": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 2,
                "item": {
                    "name": { "kind": "text" },
                    "price": { "kind": "text" },
                    "detail": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "faq": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 3,
                "item": {
                    "question": { "kind": "text" },
                    "answer": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "testimonials": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 1,
                "item": {
                    "quote": { "kind": "text" },
                    "name": { "kind": "text" },
                    "detail": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "home.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "home.subheadline": { "kind": "text" },
            "home.hero": { "kind": "media" },
            "practice.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "practice.body": { "kind": "text" },
            "practice.image": { "kind": "media" },
            "gallery": { "kind": "media[]", "min": 3 },
            "founder.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "founder.paragraphs": { "kind": "text[]", "min": 2 },
            "founder.image": { "kind": "media" },
            "intro.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "intro.body": { "kind": "text" }
        }
    },
